== diags.diag/function-value-not-a-function
BYN2824 36:17 `print` cannot be used as a value: it is built in
  help wrap it in a lambda: `text => print(text)`
BYN2824 37:18 `zeroOf` cannot be used as a value: it is generic
  help wrap it in a lambda: `() => zeroOf()`
BYN2824 38:18 `Order.zero` cannot be used as a value: it is a method
  help wrap it in a lambda: `() => Order.zero()`
BYN2824 39:18 `o.doubled` cannot be used as a value: it is a method
  help wrap it in a lambda: `() => o.doubled()`
BYN2824 40:19 `Point` cannot be used as a value: it is a constructor
  help wrap it in a lambda: `x => Point(x)`
BYN2824 41:19 `Shape.circle` cannot be used as a value: it is a union variant
  help wrap it in a lambda: `radius => Shape.circle(radius)`
BYN2824 42:19 `Order` cannot be used as a value: it is a constructor
  help wrap it in a lambda: `cents => Order(cents)`
